inal_title":null,"tagline":null,"description":"يتبع العمل قصة ضابط الشرطة الأمريكي باس ريفيس، والذي يُعد وأحد من أشهر الأبطال من أصحاب البشرة السمراء في تاريخ ولاية ميسيسيبي.","description_en":"The story of Bass Reeves, the legendary lawman of the wild West, is brought to life. Reeves worked in the post-Reconstruction era as a federal peace officer in the Indian Territory, capturing over 3,000 of the most dangerous criminals without ever being wounded—and is believed to be the inspiration for The Lone Ranger.","description_fr":"L'histoire de Bass Reeves, l'homme de loi légendaire de l'Ouest sauvage, prend vie. Il a capturé plus de 3 000 criminels parmi les plus dangereux, sans jamais être blessé. Il est considéré comme l'inspirateur du Ranger solitaire.","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/94OpFcIZ3ZExqyJgrYafo41tZSt.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/KwKRSJ1bSES8hORdQQn34QwH3V.jpg","has_poster":true,"rating":7,"vote_count":195,"age_rating":"TV-MA","year":"2023","release_date":"2023-11-05","runtime_minutes":null,"status":"Ended","country":"الولايات المتحدة","language":"الإنجليزية","genres":["دراما"],"genre_keys":["drama"],"similar":["tv247718","tv71712","tv5920","tv259909","tv56570","tv76773","tv2288","tv97951"],"director":"Chad Feehan","cast":[{"name":"ديفيد أويلو","character":"Bass Reeves","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/7UZHRwOKe2cYxj8SeNUklyPYkns.jpg"},{"name":"Lauren E. Banks","character":"Jennie Reeves","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/iWYwCbLAH2Oh2iT5dqIOjhejN9c.jpg"},{"name":"Demi Singleton","character":"Sally Reeves","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/A11knIgd0doXeZYdiwIpNkskRoy.jpg"},{"name":"Forrest Goodluck","character":"Billy Crow","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/4xjRFmyJqYZRtLODw22baOla2Ub.jpg"},{"name":"Barry Pepper","character":"Esau Pierce","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/xBvW4dMoz496rItLQU6TGteYCEP.jpg"},{"name":"دينيس كويد","character":"Marshal She