 without magic.","description_fr":"Dans un monde régi par la magie, Yuno et Asta ont grandi ensemble avec un seul but en tête : devenir le prochain Empereur-Mage du royaume de Clover. Mais si le premier est naturellement doué, le deuxième, quant à lui, ne sait pas manipuler la magie. C'est ainsi que lors de la cérémonie d'attribution de leur grimoire, Yuno reçoit le légendaire grimoire au trèfle à quatre feuilles tandis qu'Asta, lui, repart bredouille. Or, plus tard, un ancien et mystérieux ouvrage noir décoré d'un trèfle à cinq feuilles surgit devant lui ! Un grimoire d’anti-magie…","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yFw4Jmar4hixDeogAEKP9Z1zIqO.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qu9epTZh29fGUkY7ZYc9PVsv0Ig.jpg","has_poster":true,"rating":8.5,"vote_count":2318,"age_rating":"TV-14","year":"2017","release_date":"2017-10-03","runtime_minutes":24,"status":"Returning Series","country":"اليابان","language":"اليابانية","genres":["رسوم متحركة","حركة ومغامرة","خيال علمي وفانتازيا","مسلسل - رسوم متحركة"],"genre_keys":["animation","action","scifi"],"similar":["tv65930","tv15260","tv51817","tv121964","mv9323","tv43865","tv62211","tv44593"],"director":null,"cast":[{"name":"غاكوتو كاجيوارا","character":"Asta (voice)","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/kUer38jXf7vTD2TGGxJMZVYL5Te.jpg"},{"name":"نوبوناغا شيمازاكي","character":"Yuno (voice)","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/qke5rZusHsjSlvB0NKlJ5dQF5D.jpg"},{"name":"كانا يوكي","character":"Noelle Silva (voice)","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/gnKY83EbfaJWi1y47dgOtiRegAK.jpg"},{"name":"جونيتشي سوابي","character":"Yami Sukehiro (voice)","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/4S7c3n3r07A83HvkLrnWZGVhiHg.jpg"},{"name":"غينكي مورو","character":"Magna Swing (voice)","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/6YF881kJuP2HaSb5PXRO4hWTZA.jpg"},{"name":"村瀬歩","character":"Luck Voltia (voice)","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/3aGM6KpcCIEKOXP9510tz